Licensing of this AdvancedFX fork
================================

This repository contains material under different licenses. It is not
licensed entirely under MIT, and the licenses below are not alternative
choices for the same code.

mirv_pov and combined binaries
-----------------------------

The mirv_pov implementation and its integration modifications are licensed
under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 only
(SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only). The full license text is in
LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.txt. AfxHookSource2/MIRV_POV_LICENSE.md defines the source
scope, and NOTICE.md records provenance and distribution requirements.

A distributed AfxHookSource2.dll containing mirv_pov is a combined work
conveyed under AGPL-3.0-only. Each binary release provides a matching
corresponding-source archive on the same release page.

AdvancedFX and third-party material
----------------------------------

Separate AdvancedFX source material retains its original MIT license,
including Copyright (c) 2021 advancedfx.org. The complete original copyright
and permission notice is preserved in LICENSES/AdvancedFX-MIT.txt and must
be retained when distributing that material.

Separate third-party material retains its applicable licenses and notices.
Inclusion in an AGPL-covered combined binary does not remove those notices
or revoke the original licenses of separable source material.

See NOTICE.md for further licensing and provenance information.
